      "id": "sol.ahsme-1977-p10.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Setting \\(x=1\\) makes the right side the desired coefficient sum. Thus \\[ \\begin{aligned} a_7+a_6+\\cdots+a_0 &=(3\\cdot1-1)^7\\\\ &=2^7=128. \\end{aligned} \\]\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is E.",
